  "details": "Due to our fellow VR game rec room being shut down I have missed my roomie because sometimes I would just like to hang out alone but not completely alone. So maybe make roomy into VR chat but you have to have VRC plus just like they did in rec room. They made you have rec room plus in order to have it so that's what I was thinking. I feel like that would be very convenient for those who just want to hang out alone, but not completely. And honestly I really miss my roomie lol... They even had customizations for them that you could buy 🥺 I want to bring Blossom back. She's my girl. They also made it so that you could change the personality that was even better\n\nYou could call your version a not-alone buddy 🩷🌸",
